    "Id": "vehicledef_PALISADE_SLRM",
    "Name": "Palisade (SLRM)",
    "Details": "First appearing in 3056, the Palisade Defense Tank is a 60-ton defensive tank found throughout the wealthier parts of the Periphery. Based on an older tank design dating back to the Succession Wars, the Palisade is designed as a multi-role tank capable of engaging Mechs or Vehicles. Capable of speeds of 60 km/h, the Palisade (Streak LRM) is powered by a 240-rated Fuel Cell and carries 11.5 tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. The main gun is an LB-10X, with a Clan SLRM-15 supporting this at longer ranges. An MG provides some limited anti-infantry capabilities and CASE mitigates crew danger should an ammo explosion happen.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       250     30\n<b>Left</b>         200     30\n<b>Right</b>       200     30\n<b>Rear</b>        190     30\n<b>Turret</b>      200     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      1040    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Po"
  },
